# DMPM Lab Experiments

This repository contains Python implementations of all 8 experiments performed in the **Data Mining and Predictive Modelling (DMPM) Lab** as part of the B.Tech CSE (AIML) curriculum at G.I.E.T. University.

## 📚 List of Experiments

| Experiment No. | Experiment Name                                                                       |
| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 01             | Statistical Measures – Mean, Median, Mode, Variance, Standard Deviation and Quartiles |
| 02             | Dataset Upload, Pandas Library and Data Preprocessing                                 |
| 03             | Introduction to NumPy, Pandas, SciPy and Data Visualization                           |
| 04             | Correlation, Covariance, Normalization and Scaling                                    |
| 05             | Frequent Pattern Mining – Apriori, FP-Growth and Association Rules                    |
| 06             | Introduction to Scikit-learn and Decision Tree Classification                         |
| 07             | K-Nearest Neighbour (KNN) Classification                                              |
| 08             | K-Means and K-Medoids Clustering                                                      |

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Google Colab
- Jupyter Notebook
- NumPy
- Pandas
- SciPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- mlxtend

## 📂 Repository Structure

